        <item>
            <title>1.0.10</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:47:00 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/GrahamBunt/cubby-releases/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Cubby 1.0.10 prevents obsolete windows from being restored at launch.

- Blocks macOS from reopening the empty Settings window saved by older versions of Cubby.
- Keeps the menu bar panel and Capture Setup out of saved window restoration. Capture Setup remains available when access needs attention.

Your notes, clipboard history, and screenshots stay in place.
]]></description>
