            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Cubby 1.0.8 removes an unwanted blank Settings window.

- Fixes the empty “Cubby Settings” window that could appear while using the app.
- Preserves standard editing shortcuts, including copy, paste, and undo.

Your notes, clipboard history, and screenshots stay in place.
]]></description>
